Comment: Files-Excluded are dropped from upstream's SVN trunk by
 debian/import-trunk, which also drops Makefile.in, files generated
 from a .in template, and ELF objects.  They are upstream's own debian/;
 files made by autoreconf, configure and make, including the info and
 HTML manuals and the Designers Guide PDF; editor and interpreter
 leftovers; and HOWTOs/Bible/Bible-Preview.pdf, an excerpt of a book
 with neither license nor sources.

